# Frontend Design Rules for Nest Project

## 🎯 Mandatory Design Patterns

When creating or updating any frontend component, STRICTLY follow these established patterns from our trading dialog optimization:

### 1. Dialog/Modal Structure (REQUIRED)
```tsx
// ALWAYS use this exact structure for all dialogs
<DialogContent className="max-w-3xl max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
  <DialogHeader className="space-y-3 pb-6">
    <DialogTitle className="text-2xl font-bold flex items-center gap-3">
      <div className="w-8 h-8 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
        <Icon className="w-4 h-4 text-primary" />
      </div>
      Dialog Title
    </DialogTitle>
    <DialogDescription className="text-base">
      Detailed description text
    </DialogDescription>
  </DialogHeader>
  
  <div className="space-y-8">
    {/* Progress indicator for multi-step flows */}
    <div className="flex items-center justify-center">
      <div className="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium">1</div>
        <div className="h-1 w-16 bg-primary"></div>
        <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-muted text-muted-foreground flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium">2</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    {/* Content sections */}
  </div>
  
  {/* Action buttons */}
  <div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between gap-4 pt-6 border-t">
    <Button variant="outline" className="h-11">Cancel</Button>
    <div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
      <Button variant="outline" className="h-11">Secondary</Button>
      <Button className="h-11">
        Primary Action
      </Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</DialogContent>
```

### 2. Card Layouts (MANDATORY)
```tsx
// Standard action card with dashed border
<Card className="border-2 border-dashed border-muted-foreground/20 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors">
  <CardHeader className="text-center pb-4">
    <div className="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
      <Icon className="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" />
    </div>
    <CardTitle className="text-lg">Section Title</CardTitle>
    <CardDescription>Brief description</CardDescription>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent>{/* Content */}</CardContent>
</Card>

// Important information card
<Card className="bg-muted/30 border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800">
  <CardHeader className="pb-3">
    <CardTitle className="text-lg flex items-center gap-2">
      <Icon className="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
      Information Title
    </CardTitle>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent>{/* Grid or info display */}</CardContent>
</Card>
```

### 3. Form Elements (STRICT REQUIREMENTS)
```tsx
// ALL form elements MUST use h-11 height
<Input className="h-11" />
<Select><SelectTrigger className="h-11" /></Select>
<Button className="h-11" />

// Labels MUST include icons
<Label className="text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
  <Icon className="w-4 h-4 text-{color}-600" />
  Field Name
</Label>
```

### 4. Enhanced Select Items (REQUIRED)
```tsx
// ALWAYS structure select items this way
<SelectItem value="option">
  <div className="flex items-center gap-3 py-1">
    <div className="w-8 h-8 bg-{color}-50 dark:bg-{color}-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
      <Icon className="w-4 h-4 text-{color}-600" />
    </div>
    <div className="flex flex-col">
      <span className="font-medium">Primary Text</span>
      <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
        <Badge variant="outline" className="text-xs">Type</Badge>
        <span className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Secondary info</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SelectItem>

// Simple select with color dots
<SelectItem value="option">
  <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
    <div className="w-2 h-2 bg-{color}-500 rounded-full"></div>
    Option Name
  </div>
</SelectItem>
```

### 5. Information Grid Display (MANDATORY)
```tsx
<div className="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
  <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
    <div className="w-8 h-8 bg-{color}-100 dark:bg-{color}-900/30 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
      <Icon className="w-4 h-4 text-{color}-600" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Label</p>
      <p className="font-medium">Value</p>
